">Usually, when we do a</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">high five, we use one hand each. That's because there are five fingers on one hand. In this game, you will be using both hands, but still only putting up five fingers!</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>How many different ways can you do a high five using combinations of fingers from both hands?</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]